<title>MOROCCO: Cape Verde PM meets Moroccan king.</title>
<headline>Cape Verde PM meets Moroccan king.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Visiting Cape Verde Prime Minister Carlos Veiga met Morocco's King Hassan privately on Monday, the official Moroccan news agency MAP said.</p>
<p>Veiga, heading a delegation of ministers and government officials, earlier met Moroccan Prime Minister Abdellatif Filali.</p>
<p>The visiting prime minister said Cape Verde wanted to strengthen cooperation with Morocco and benefit from its experience in fisheries, professional training and tourism.</p>
</text>
